格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Connect DeepSeek Harness (dsh) to Cursor and Codex: ACP agent bundle, MCP server, skills, and config templates","id":"gh:1334618159","install_available":false,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-cursor-codex","slug":"jeremy9682/dsh-cursor-codex","topics":["dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Connect DeepSeek Harness (dsh) to Cursor and Codex: ACP agent bundle, MCP server, skills, and config"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"epSeek Harness (dsh) to Cursor and Codex: ACP agent bundle, MCP server, skills, and config templates"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-cursor-codex"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Connect DeepSeek Harness (`dsh`) to the Cursor editor and the OpenAI Codex CLI — as an ACP agent, an"},{"id":"p3s2","text":" MCP server, or a headless worker."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"| Directory | What it is |"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"| `acp/` | npm bundle `@jeremy9682/dsh-acp`: `dsh plugin --profile acp add @jeremy9682/dsh-acp` → `d"},{"id":"p5s2","text":"sh --profile acp` boots an Agent Client Protocol stdio server over your existing dsh composition (sh"},{"id":"p5s3","text":"ared credentials, model settings, and session logs). |\n| `server/` | Zero-dependency MCP stdio serve"},{"id":"p5s4","text":"r exposing `dsh_delegate` and `dsh_health` to Cursor, Codex, and other MCP clients. |\n| `skills/` | "},{"id":"p5s5","text":"Agent skills teaching Cursor and Codex when and how to delegate to dsh. |\n| `templates/` | Ready-mad"},{"id":"p5s6","text":"e `mcp.json`, Cursor custom subagent, and Codex `dsh.config.toml` profiles. |\n| `registry/` | The `d"},{"id":"p5s7","text":"sh-acp` entry (agent.json + icon) submitted to the official ACP registry. |\n| `docs/` | Channel-sele"},{"id":"p5s8","text":"ction guide (EN/ZH) plus cookbooks for integration overlays and fleet governance (Codex as DSH subag"},{"id":"p5s9","text":"ent, third-party adapter → DeepSeek, port-3082 rehearsal). |"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Quick start"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Both `2b` and `2c` ship skills: install `skills/cursor-delegate-to-dsh` and `skills/codex-delegate-t"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"o-dsh` into the respective editor's skills directory so the agent knows when to delegate."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Why three channels?"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"Cursor and Codex are ACP *agents*, not ACP clients — neither can load a third-party ACP agent today."},{"id":"p10s2","text":" The full picture, verified against official docs, is in `docs/integration-guide.md`."},{"id":"p11s1","text":"## Verified"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"- ACP profile: `initialize` → `session/new` → `session/prompt` → streamed answer → `end_turn` (teste"},{"id":"p12s2","text":"d against dsh 0.1.0-rc.6).\n- MCP server: `initialize` → `tools/list` → `dsh_health` → `dsh_delegate`"},{"id":"p12s3","text":" real task (tested against dsh 0.1.0-rc.6)."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Safe DSH upgrades for Cursor ACP"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"The Cursor provider includes `dsh-cursor-upgrade-gate`. It stages a requested DSH package away from "},{"id":"p14s2","text":"the active installation, probes the cross-provider replay-filter behavior, applies the narrow compat"},{"id":"p14s3","text":"ibility patch only when the behavior is still broken, and requires an external Cursor smoke before a"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"n atomic `current`-symlink promotion. See `cursor-provider/README.md`. Direct global reinstall is in"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"tentionally outside this path because it can erase a local compatibility fix before validation."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
